From 676cfcf2456d58830e0446d9d5baf26069636490 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rdyplayerB <rdyplayerb@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:09:47 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(otsuka): probe gate on the full solve

QUIP_OTSUKA_BP_SOLVE_MAX=<milli, offset included>: a probed candidate gets the full
solve only when its verified probe energy is at or under the limit; the walk over the
probe order stops at the first candidate above it. Nothing clears: no full solve, the
miner goes to the next ladder. No verified probe: the limit is not applied.
